   "h": 1007,
   "w": 1440,
   "bg": "rgb(247, 247, 244)",
   "bgImg": "",
   "items": [
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 230,
     "y": 42,
     "w": 824,
     "h": 58,
     "html": "<h2 data-f=\"47\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"center\">¿Cómo cuidar una herida quirúrgica?</h2>",
     "fs": 47,
     "lh": "normal",
     "color": "rgb(160, 121, 109)",
     "align": "center",
     "fw": "400",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
    {
     "k": "caja",
     "x": 52,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 648,
     "h": 383,
     "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)",
     "bimg": "",
     "rad": "0px",
     "borde": "",
     "sombra": 0
    },
    {
     "k": "img",
     "x": 52,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 344,
     "h": 344,
     "src": "1da153_bb7640c042634eb1a309adacb00fc92f~mv2.png",
     "alt": "Lavado de manos con espuma.png",
     "fit": "cover",
     "rad": "0px",
     "link": ""
    },
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 412,
     "y": 204,
     "w": 258,
     "h": 70,
     "html": "<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\" data-b=\"1\">1. Lávese&nbsp;las manos con agua y jabón líquido antes de tocar la herida.</p>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "22.4px",
     "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "700",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
    {
     "k": "caja",
     "x": 740,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 648,
     "h": 383,
     "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)",
     "bimg": "",
     "rad": "0px",
     "borde": "",
     "sombra": 0
    },
    {
     "k": "img",
     "x": 740,
     "y": 152,
     "w": 344,
     "h": 344,
     "src": "1da153_3038fd5ca96d477daeb8580e2e80d00c~mv2.png",
     "alt": "Cuidado de suturas con antiséptico.png",
     "fit": "cover",
     "rad": "0px",
     "link": ""
    },
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 1100,
     "y": 204,
     "w": 258,
     "h": 291,
     "html": "<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\" data-b=\"1\">2.&nbsp;La&nbsp;herida debe lavarse. Puede usar agua y jabón neutro, tratando de eliminar todo residuo de sangre u otra materia que pudiera haberse acumulado. </p>\n\n<p data-f=\"16\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\">Es muy importante la higiene diaria (el periodo de limpieza puede variar de acuerdo al tipo de herida).</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\"></p>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "22.4px",
     "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "700",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
    {
     "k": "caja",
     "x": 52,
     "y": 575,
     "w": 648,
     "h": 383,
     "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)",
     "bimg": "",
     "rad": "0px",
     "borde": "",
     "sombra": 0
    },
    {
     "k": "img",
     "x": 52,
     "y": 575,
     "w": 344,
     "h": 344,
     "src": "1da153_c0026800b4c445e4850452f01293d982~mv2.png",
     "alt": "Cuidado de incisión con suturas.png",
     "fit": "cover",
     "rad": "0px",
     "link": ""
    },
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 412,
     "y": 627,
     "w": 258,
     "h": 70,
     "html": "<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\" data-b=\"1\">3. Seque&nbsp;perfectamente la herida con una gasa o toalla limpia.</p>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "22.4px",
     "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "700",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
    {
     "k": "caja",
     "x": 740,
     "y": 575,
     "w": 648,
     "h": 383,
     "bg": "rgb(220, 232, 236)",
     "bimg": "",
     "rad": "0px",
     "borde": "",
     "sombra": 0
    },
    {
     "k": "img",
     "x": 740,
     "y": 575,
     "w": 344,
     "h": 344,
     "src": "1da153_cc9141fc57034cb4a11f793bf155a4b7~mv2.png",
     "alt": "Aplicación de apósito transparente sobre gasa.png",
     "fit": "cover",
     "rad": "0px",
     "link": ""
    },
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 1100,
     "y": 627,
     "w": 258,
     "h": 256,
     "html": "<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\" data-b=\"1\">4. Cubra&nbsp;la herida con una gasa limpia si así lo indicó su médico. </p>\n\n<p data-f=\"16\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(49, 90, 107)\" data-a=\"start\">Por momentos puede mantener descubiertas sus heridas, siempre asegurándose de que su casa, cuarto, sábanas o hamaca se encuentren limpios.</p>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "22.4px",
     "color": "rgb(49, 90, 107)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "700",
     "ls": "normal"
    }
   ]
  },
